  description: '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuner DARK monsters

    If this card is Synchro
    Summoned: You can add 1 card that mentions "Red Dragon Archfiend" from your Deck
    to your hand. When your opponent activates a monster effect (Quick Effect): You
    can banish this card you control; Special Summon 1 "Red Dragon Archfiend" from
    your Extra Deck (this is treated as a Synchro Summon), and if you do, its ATK
    becomes doubled, also it cannot be destroyed by your opponent''s card effects.
    You can only use each effect of "The Crimson King" once per turn.'
